WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.244
(inspirational music)

00:00:01.244 --> 00:00:04.411
(bike gears whizzing)

00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:08.883
- BMX is a fast-paced sport.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:12.470
From the time that that gate drops,

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.320
until you cross the finish line,

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.633
you are always thinking
about your next move.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.030
As long as I can keep those
two wheels on the ground,

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:25.880
I'm gonna be out there on that track.

00:00:32.839 --> 00:00:34.940
(subtle piano music)

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:37.820
My name is Kittie Weston-Knauer,

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:40.090
and I am 70 years old.

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:42.810
I am the oldest female BMX racer

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:44.063
in the United States.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:48.178
I have been involved in
the sport of BMX racing

00:00:48.178 --> 00:00:53.178
as a racer for 30 years now.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.620
And I love challenges.

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:57.050
And this was just another challenge.

00:00:57.050 --> 00:00:59.640
When I began racing BMX,

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:02.610
there was no women's cruiser class.

00:01:02.610 --> 00:01:05.060
I worked with our sanctioning bodies

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:07.170
and talked about the fact that

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:09.630
women want to be a part of this.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:13.410
We now have thousands of women and girls

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:15.513
who race throughout the country.

00:01:16.545 --> 00:01:20.212
♪ And the rockets red glare ♪

00:01:22.143 --> 00:01:25.300
- [Announcer] Here we
go, 56 and over women.

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:27.462
Seventy years young, Miss Kittie Weston-Knauer,

00:01:27.462 --> 00:01:28.820
sitting in that three slot.

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:29.653
More total points for her.

00:01:29.653 --> 00:01:30.486
(gate crashes)

00:01:30.486 --> 00:01:31.800
- [Girl] Go, Miss Kittie!

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:34.985
- Throughout each year, I will do

00:01:34.985 --> 00:01:38.570
anywhere from 25 to 30 races.

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:43.183
And quite often, I'm racing
much, much younger women.

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:46.767
I’ve finished seventh in the world

00:01:46.767 --> 00:01:50.790
in the 45 and over women's cruiser class.

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:53.380
I was the oldest female

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:57.770
to participate in the UCI BMX Worlds.

00:01:57.770 --> 00:01:59.183
It's just unbelievable.

00:02:00.290 --> 00:02:02.230
This can be a dangerous sport.

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:07.230
In 1993, I was involved
in an accident where,

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:09.763
after falling off of my
bike, I broke my neck.

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:13.273
I was told that I might not
be able to walk again.

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:17.420
But within six months,
I was back to racing.

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:23.170
And I have continued to
be involved in the sport.

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:24.267
- Miss Kittie.

00:02:24.267 --> 00:02:26.825
Morning, Miss Kittie!

00:02:26.825 --> 00:02:29.075
(cheering)

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:32.622
- Thank you, thank you.

00:02:32.622 --> 00:02:33.455
Good ride.

00:02:34.570 --> 00:02:36.840
You know, people have asked me:

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:40.430
How long do I plan to
keep racing BMX bikes?

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:42.630
I tell people, age is nothing but a number.

00:02:42.630 --> 00:02:43.993
And I seriously mean that.

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:47.422
Every time I get out on that track, I win.

00:02:47.422 --> 00:02:49.447
- You got this, Miss Kittie.
- And it's not about crossing

00:02:49.447 --> 00:02:51.860
first, second, or third,

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:54.380
but it's about having fun.

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:57.550
It's about the enjoyment
of being with others

00:02:57.550 --> 00:02:59.230
who really enjoy this sport.

00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:02.050
(gentle music)

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:03.823
I want to continue to enjoy life.

00:03:04.820 --> 00:03:06.423
And this is a part of my life.

00:03:07.752 --> 00:03:10.335
(gentle music)

